## How to Fine-Tune with OpenAI

Once you have 50+ records:

```bash
# 1. Download the JSONL file
curl https://lotto-machine-wr6t.onrender.com/api/v1/training/export \
  -o kill_chain_snapshots.jsonl

# 2. Validate format
openai tools fine_tunes.prepare_data -f kill_chain_snapshots.jsonl

# 3. Upload and start fine-tune
openai api fine_tuning.jobs.create \
  -t kill_chain_snapshots.jsonl \
  -m gpt-4o-mini \
  --suffix "kill-chain-v1"

# 4. Monitor
openai api fine_tuning.jobs.list

# 5. Use the fine-tuned model
# Update OPENROUTER_API_KEY or add OPENAI_FINETUNE_MODEL env var
```

