## How to Extend the Snapshot Payload

To add new fields to training records, modify `TrainButton` in `SignalChainView.tsx`:

```tsx
body: JSON.stringify({
  payload: {
    ...d,                          // full kill-shots-live response
    my_extra_field: someValue,     // add here
  },
  label: d.reconciled_verdict ?? d.verdict,
  note: 'Manual label from operator',
}),
```

The `payload` is stored verbatim in the JSONL `user` message. The fine-tuned model will learn to use whatever fields you include.

